OL,3,GNEWSA'Cats are being killed by loose
OL,4,Adogs in our neighbourhood'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of two Leeds suburbs have
OL,7,Fcalled for the owner of two dogs blamed
OL,8,Ffor the deaths of pets and wildlife to
OL,9,Fbe prosecuted.
OL,11,FA black Labrador and a brown
OL,12,Fcross-breed are believed to be
OL,13,Fresponsible for killing several cats
OL,14,Fand a fox in the Meanwood and Moortown
OL,15,Fareas after escaping from their garden.
OL,17,FThe dogs' owner told the BBC a friend
OL,18,Fhad been leaving the outside gate of
OL,19,Fhis house unlocked, but said he was
OL,20,Funaware of the attacks.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
