OL,3,GNEWSA'Cats are being killed by loose
OL,4,Adogs in our neighbourhood'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeeds City Council said it was aware of
OL,7,Fthe community's concerns regarding the
OL,8,F"out-of-control dogs" but would not
OL,9,Fcomment further due to "ongoing legal
OL,10,Faction".
